@startuml seq-email-v2
title 邮件通知时序（v2）
autonumber
skinparam maxMessageSize 190

participant "RegistrationService" as Svc
participant "EventBus" as Bus
participant "NotificationObserver" as Msg
participant "MessageRepository" as MsgRepo
participant "EmailNotifier" as Mail
participant "EmailRepository" as MailRepo
participant "MockEmailSender" as Sender
participant "失败日志" as Log

Svc -> Bus: publish(RegistrationEvent approved / rejected)
Bus -> Msg: handle(event)
Msg -> MsgRepo: add(..., dedupe_key)
MsgRepo --> Msg: 是否新增
Bus -> Mail: handle(event)
Mail -> MailRepo: add(..., dedupe_key=email:{type}:{rid}:{status})
MailRepo --> Mail: email_id 或 0（已存在）

alt 首次（email_id > 0）
  Mail -> Sender: send(to_addr, subject, body)
  alt 发送成功
    Sender --> Mail: ok
    Mail -> MailRepo: mark_sent(email_id)
  else 发送失败
    Sender --> Mail: raise Exception
    Mail -> MailRepo: mark_failed(email_id, error)
    Mail -> Log: 追加错误记录
  end
  Note over Mail: 异常被本观察者捕获，\n不向上抛，报名事务不受影响
else 重复事件（email_id = 0）
  Mail -> Mail: 跳过，不再发送
end
@enduml
